message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Pixel Photo Manager"
abstract: >
  Pixel Photo Manager is a desktop photo management application for Windows.
  It features non-destructive editing, facial recognition and clustering,
  Picasa contact sheet import, duplicate detection, and video support,
  built with Python and PySide6.
authors:
